Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.99,TL,,0,0,0,,擦网为啥喊 {\fs78}let{\fs68}？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.24,0:00:05.36,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Let, first serve.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N擦网 一发重发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:10.84,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Let, first serve.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N擦网 一发重发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.64,0:00:18.24,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Let, first serve.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N擦网 一发重发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:19.34,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's the hat trick.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是第三个了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:22.98,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Let.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N擦网重发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.68,0:00:26.48,TL,,0,0,0,,连着{\fs78}4{\fs68}个擦网 主裁喊了{\fs78}4{\fs68}次 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:27.89,TL,,0,0,0,,球明明碰的是网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.89,0:00:29.57,TL,,0,0,0,,为什么不喊 {\fs78}net{\fs68}？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.28,0:00:31.88,TL,,0,0,0,,答案
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.88,0:00:34.96,TL,,0,0,0,,藏在一个快被忘掉的古英语词里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:37.20,TL,,0,0,0,,英语里有两个 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:39.50,TL,,0,0,0,,常用的那个是让 允许
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.50,0:00:42.09,TL,,0,0,0,,网球里这个 来自另一个古英语词
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.09,0:00:45.15,TL,,0,0,0,,意思几乎相反 阻碍 耽搁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.68,0:00:49.25,TL,,0,0,0,,这个意思 日常口语里早就不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.25,0:00:51.95,TL,,0,0,0,,却留在了法律文书和球场上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.08,0:00:54.84,TL,,0,0,0,,英国护照首页印着 {\fs78}without{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.84,0:00:57.12,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}let{\fs68} {\fs78}or{\fs68} {\fs78}hindrance{\fs68} 通行无阻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.12,0:00:57.88,TL,,0,0,0,,这里的 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.88,0:01:00.24,TL,,0,0,0,,和 {\fs78}hindrance{\fs68} 一样 是阻碍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.88,0:01:03.06,TL,,0,0,0,,所以主裁喊 {\fs78}let{\fs68} 宣布的是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.06,0:01:05.43,TL,,0,0,0,,这一分被阻碍了 不算
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:08.41,TL,,0,0,0,,国际网联的规则写得更宽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.41,0:01:10.06,TL,,0,0,0,,只要这一分被意外打断
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.06,0:01:12.37,TL,,0,0,0,,就判 {\fs78}let{\fs68} 再打一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.88,0:01:15.11,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2022{\fs68}年鹿特丹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.11,0:01:17.18,TL,,0,0,0,,奥热-阿利亚西姆打完这一分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.18,0:01:19.82,TL,,0,0,0,,以为拿下了赛点 赢下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.48,0:01:22.71,TL,,0,0,0,,可就在这一分里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.71,0:01:25.09,TL,,0,0,0,,穆雷的帽子掉在了地上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.59,0:01:29.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm not trying to cheat.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我不是想耍赖
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.75,0:01:32.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I hit the ball and my hat fell off immediately,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我一击球 帽子就掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.41,0:01:34.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and I stopped, okay?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我就停了 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.17,0:01:36.87,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I promise that's what happened. I'm sorry.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我保证就是这样 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.23,0:01:39.33,TL,,0,0,0,,两人同意 再打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.53,0:01:42.38,TL,,0,0,0,,巡回赛规则里 帽子掉落 口袋掉球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.38,0:01:44.31,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次判 {\fs78}let{\fs68} 再犯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.31,0:01:47.03,TL,,0,0,0,,就算妨碍对手 直接丢分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.53,0:01:49.92,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年澳网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:51.41,TL,,0,0,0,,一根羽毛飘进场地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.41,0:01:53.62,TL,,0,0,0,,兹维列夫捡起来给主裁看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.62,0:01:55.60,TL,,0,0,0,,球滚进场 纸片被吹进来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.60,0:01:57.42,TL,,0,0,0,,都算意外干扰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.53,0:01:59.59,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月初中网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.59,0:02:02.27,TL,,0,0,0,,兹维列夫说发球时广告屏变了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.27,0:02:04.42,TL,,0,0,0,,回看后 判 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.39,0:02:10.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I mean, this must be one of the most stupid change of rules that I've ever heard in my life.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是我听过最蠢的规则改动之一
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.05,0:02:14.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}There is no sense if a player sees{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这说不通 球员要是看到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.25,0:02:18.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}that there is a hindrance of that shot, he stops immediately.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N那一拍受了干扰 会马上停下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.73,0:02:23.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I mean, we can play a 30-shot rally and he can lose the point,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我们打了三十拍 他丢了这一分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.71,0:02:25.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}he's like, OK, I'm going to challenge now.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N然后说 好 我现在要挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.33,0:02:27.83,TL,,0,0,0,,他气的是对手打完几拍 丢了分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.83,0:02:29.71,TL,,0,0,0,,才申请回看 另外
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.71,0:02:31.77,TL,,0,0,0,,观众喊叫不算干扰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.43,0:02:34.51,TL,,0,0,0,,最常见的 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.51,0:02:36.70,TL,,0,0,0,,还是发球擦网 只重发这一发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.70,0:02:39.42,TL,,0,0,0,,一发还是一发 二发还是二发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.83,0:02:42.46,TL,,0,0,0,,今年温网{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.46,0:02:43.95,TL,,0,0,0,,大坂直美对穆霍娃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.95,0:02:45.43,TL,,0,0,0,,又一个擦网 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.43,0:02:47.29,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}BBC{\fs68} 解说纳芙拉蒂洛娃说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.29,0:02:49.26,TL,,0,0,0,,取消吧 没用
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.63,0:02:52.72,TL,,0,0,0,,她的理由是 大多数擦网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.72,0:02:54.72,TL,,0,0,0,,只是轻轻蹭了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.23,0:02:57.90,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}ATP{\fs68} 早就试过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.90,0:02:59.01,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2017{\fs68}年起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.01,0:03:01.19,TL,,0,0,0,,新生代总决赛不再有发球 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.19,0:03:02.73,TL,,0,0,0,,擦了网也接着打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.73,0:03:04.48,TL,,0,0,0,,国际网联的规则附录里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.48,0:03:06.30,TL,,0,0,0,,也留着这种打法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.73,0:03:11.40,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年澳网表演赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:12.76,TL,,0,0,0,,郑钦文搭档德约
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.76,0:03:15.53,TL,,0,0,0,,打快四赛制 发球擦网不重发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.53,0:03:16.83,TL,,0,0,0,,她这边以为要重发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.83,0:03:19.32,TL,,0,0,0,,这一分丢了 还被破了发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.13,0:03:21.96,TL,,0,0,0,,就是这一发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.95,0:03:24.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh man, these rules.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N天哪 这规则
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.99,0:03:26.61,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I had no idea that was going to happen.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我完全没想到会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.41,0:03:28.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I forgot.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.67,0:03:30.34,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}let{\fs68} 不只网球在用
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.34,0:03:31.69,TL,,0,0,0,,乒乓球发球擦网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.69,0:03:33.26,TL,,0,0,0,,同样判 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.62,0:03:38.42,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You also get yes lets, which is when you get the clearing player,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N还有 {\fs78}yes{\fs68} {\fs78}let{\fs68} 让位的一方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:42.08,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}the non-striker, and the striker who's going in to hit the ball,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也就是非击球方 和上前击球的一方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.08,0:03:44.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and they just clash, and no one's really at fault.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N撞在了一起 谁都没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:47.09,TL,,0,0,0,,壁球里两人撞上 谁都没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.09,0:03:48.40,TL,,0,0,0,,也判 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.76,0:03:50.84,TL,,0,0,0,,羽毛球也有 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.84,0:03:53.27,TL,,0,0,0,,可它的发球擦网过去 照打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.27,0:03:55.29,TL,,0,0,0,,所以 {\fs78}let{\fs68} 不是让 是挡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.29,0:03:56.99,TL,,0,0,0,,下次听到主裁喊 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.99,0:03:59.88,TL,,0,0,0,,你就知道 刚才那一下 被挡住了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.88,0:04:01.13,TL,,0,0,0,,要是由你来定规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.13,0:04:03.74,TL,,0,0,0,,发球擦网 还要不要重来？
